ctInfo"><p class="k_4b0a5fa_productKicker">THE KEYCAP COLLECTION</p><h1>Starplayer / Keys</h1><div class="k_4b0a5fa_tags"><span>Keycap concept</span><span>In development</span></div><dl class="k_4b0a5fa_specs"><div><dt>PALETTE</dt><dd>Crimson / Violet</dd></div><div><dt>SERIES</dt><dd>Cover / 01</dd></div></dl><p class="k_4b0a5fa_description">Reyna, remixed. Red and violet album-cover energy flows across a field of individual keys. A companion concept to the Starplayer glass edition.</p><button class="k_4b0a5fa_more" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog">see more<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><a class="k_4b0a5fa_primaryButton" href="/#newsletter">Get release updates<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="k_4b0a5fa_conceptNote">Design preview. Final product details to be announced.</p></div><div class="k_4b0a5fa_stageBottom"><span class="k_4b0a5fa_studyLabel">KIKORA / DESIGN STUDY</span><span class="k_4b0a5fa_studyLabel">01 / 01</span><span class="k_4b0a5fa_help">CONCEPT / NOT YET AVAILABLE</span></div></section><dialog class="k_6b28d44_dialog" aria-labelledby="_R_j_-title"><div class="k_6b28d44_shell"><header class="k_6b28d44_header"><span class="k_6b28d44_eyebrow">KIKORA / Product notes</span><button type="button" class="k_6b28d44_close" autofocus="" aria-label="Close product details"><span class="k_6b28d44_closeText">Close</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 6 12 12M6 18 18 6"></path></svg></button></header><div class="k_6b28d44_layout"><div class="k_6b28d44_main"><div class="k_6b28d44_intro"><p class="k_6b28d44_index">02 / KEYCAPS</p><h2 id="_R_j_-title">Keycaps</h2><p>Reyna. Red light. A different kind of record.</p></div><figure class="k_6b28d44_visual k_6b28d44_keysVisual"><img alt="KIKORA Reyna keycap concept: red and violet character artwork flowing across individual keycaps on a silver-gray keyboard" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 60vw" class="k_6b28d44_keycapsImage" src="{{ 'kikora-images-kagura-keycaps-cover.webp' | asset_url }}" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;inset:0;color:transparent" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="k_6b28d44_conceptBadge">Concept / In development</span><figcaption>Keycaps / printed artwork study<span>Layout and profile to be confirmed</span></figcaption></figure><div class="k_6b28d44_tabList" role="tablist" aria-label="Keycaps information"><button type="button" role="tab" id="_R_j_-tab-specs" aria-controls="_R_j_-panel-specs" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" class="k_6b28d44_tab">Specs<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="_R_j_-tab-story" aria-controls="_R_j_-panel-story" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="k_6b28d44_tab">Story<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="_R_j_-tab-faq" aria-controls="_R_j_-panel-faq" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="k_6b28d44_tab">FAQ<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div><section role="tabpanel" id="_R_j_-panel-specs" aria-labelledby="_R_j_-tab-specs" tabindex="0" class="k_6b28d44_panel"><p class="k_6b28d44_panelLead">The details are in development.</p><dl class="k_6b28d44_specs"><div><dt>Palette study</dt><dd>Crimson / Violet / Charcoal</dd></div><div><dt>Materials &amp; process</dt><dd>To be confirmed</dd></div><div><dt>Profile &amp; kit</dt><dd>To be confirmed</dd></div><div><dt>Compatibility</dt><dd>To be confirmed</dd></div><div><dt>Status</dt><dd>In development</dd></div></dl><p class="k_6b28d44_specNote">Final specifications, pricing, and release timing will be shared as development progresses.</p></section><section role="tabpanel" id="_R_j_-panel-story" aria-labelledby="_R_j_-tab-story" hidden="" tabindex="0" class="k_6b28d44_panel"><p class="k_6b28d44_panelLead">One artwork. Across every key.</p><p>The Cover series brings the atmosphere of a record sleeve to your keyboard. Reyna artwork is composed across individual keycap tops, framed by charcoal modifiers. This is an independent character remix concept, with no official collaboration implied. Materials, printing methods, profiles, and compatibility are still to be confirmed.</p><p class="k_6b28d44_storySignoff">KIKORA / Objects for your everyday.</p></section><section role="tabpanel" id="_R_j_-panel-faq" aria-labelledby="_R_j_-tab-faq" hidden="" tabindex="0" class="k_6b28d44_panel k_6b28d44_faq"><details open=""><summary>Which keyboards will the keycaps fit?</summary><p>Layout compatibility, keycap profile, and kit contents have not been announced. The image illustrates a design direction rather than a final kit.</p></details><details><summary>What are the confirmed specifications?</summary><p>The current preview communicates a design direction. Final materials, dimensions, construction, and compatibility have not been announced.</p></details><details><summary>How can I hear about the release?</summary><p>This product direction is in development.<!-- --> Pricing and release timing have not been announced. Visit the <a href="/#newsletter">release newsletter</a> for future updates.</p></details></section></div><aside class="k_6b28d44_aside" aria-label="Product overview"><span class="k_6b28d44_eyebrow">KIKORA / <!-- -->Keycaps</span><h3>A new point of contact.</h3><p class="k_6b28d44_asideDescription">Character art, reimagined across individual keycaps. A visual companion to the Starplayer glass edition.</p><div class="k_6b28d44_status"><span aria-hidden="true"></span>In development</div><p class="k_6b28d44_releaseNote">Specs to be confirmed. Release details to come.</p><a class="k_6b28d44_primaryLink" href="/#newsletter">Get release updates<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="k_6b28d44_asideFooter"><span>KIKORA</span><span>Your desk.<br/>Your own expression.</span></div></aside></div></div></dialog></div></main><footer class="k_45aaab5_footer"><div class="k_45aaab5_footerGrid"><div class="k_45aaab5_footerBrand"><a aria-label="KIKORA home